# Substack-first essay import workflow

Substack is canonical. The website stores the essay chamber and relationship metadata; Medium is an optional mirror. Do not copy full publication prose into the website intake.

For new work, provide title, subtitle, publication date, canonical/Substack URL, optional Medium URL, and optional featured image. Run `content:essay:preview` before apply. Apply only after user approval.

Legacy Medium-only intakes remain valid during migration. Do not claim a Substack publication exists until it has been matched and reviewed.

Do not hand-edit generated essay modules, automatically create Atlas relationships, or alter existing IDs and slugs. Use `content:substack:inventory` for read-only matching.
